CATCAS_SERIES_PARALLEL_RELATION 1
TYPE BOOLEAN_F3
NODE V EXTERNAL
NODE B EXTERNAL
NODE T INTERNAL
NODE X INTERNAL
NODE Y INTERNAL
RELATION R_TB B T 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_YT T Y 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_VY Y V 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_XT T X 0 2 1 0
RELATION R_VX X V 0 2 1 0
ELIMINATE X
ELIMINATE Y
ELIMINATE T
END
